            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mguu wa kulia wa nyuma wa mnyama wa sadaka zenu za amani mtampa kuhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mguu huo utakuwa mali ya kuhani aliye mzawa wa Aroni anayetoa damu ya sadaka za amani na mafuta yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu amewaagiza watu wa Israeli watenge kidari hicho na mguu huo wa mnyama wa sadaka zao za amani, wampe kuhani Aroni na wazawa wake, maana sehemu hiyo wamewekewa hao makuhani milele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyo ndiyo sehemu iliyotengwa kwa ajili ya Aroni na wanawe kutoka katika sadaka anazotolewa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa moto, tangu siku walipotawazwa kuwa makuhani wa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipowekwa wakfu kwa kupakwa mafuta, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliamuru Waisraeli wawape sehemu hiyo ya sadaka; hiyo itakuwa daima haki yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
