          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alimpa Mose amri hizi mlimani Sinai siku ile alipowaamuru Waisraeli wamletee sadaka zao, kule jangwani Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
